<td><i>This is a photo taken by <b>Joel Baldwin</b> when working as a staff photographer of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Look_(American_magazine)" class="extiw" title="en:Look (American magazine)">LOOK Magazine</a>, and is part of the <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://guides.loc.gov/american-women-prints-photographs/photojournalism/look-photo-collection">LOOK Magazine Photograph Collection</a> at the <a href="/wiki/Library_of_Congress" title="Library of Congress">Library of Congress</a>. Their former owner, Cowles Communications, Inc, <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.loc.gov/rr/print/res/074_look.html">dedicated to the public all rights it owned to these images</a> as an instrument of gift.</i>
